{
  "$comment": [
    "Declared export surface of public/hyphon_native.wasm — the one list of its C API.",
    "emscripten/build.sh exports exactly this (tools/hyphon_native_exports.mjs), and",
    "tools/check_wasm_export_map.mjs fails the build on any drift from it.",
    "`required` exports are called by shipped worklet / engine code — a build that",
    "drops one of them is broken.",
    "`optional` exports are always built but not called by shipped code (the immediate API stays for tooling and host tests).",
    "`runtime` names are added by Emscripten itself (pthread internals); never requested.",
    "Each HYPHON_EXPORT_VOICE(prefix, ...) engine contributes prefix_create/_destroy/_init/",
    "_push_event/_render/_cancel_notes/_flush (src/__tests__/wasmExportManifest.voices.test.ts).",
    "Anything present in the export map but listed in no bucket is reported as",
    "unexpected export bloat."
  ],
